{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"636012145204527127","content":"Well, I guess I will get ahead of the cheese train that will be coming on Friday….\nI am really going to miss you guys. Today will be my final day of real rp. Anything past this will be light and infrequent. I had so much fun every day, it was a pleasure to wake up and talk to you all. I love Cato, easily my favorite character I have ever played. This was awesome, so much genuine growth in the story. Seeing people change in organic and meaningful ways. This was something special, something unique that we had the opportunity to participate in. Remember the good times we had together, and the bad times that had us pissed. You can’t get to the incredible mountains, without the horrid valleys. I love all of you, thank you for playing with me. -Tanner\nSee you next year 😉","created_at":"2020-08-17T17:33:47.815000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-17T17:37:13.228000Z","id":"744972260485365830","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
